  "title": "Modify the program ….",
  "body": " Modify the program …  If the sum never reaches 2.0, the loop would never terminate. But the loop does stop! How many repetitions did it make before it stopped?  On line 9 (not indented), print the value of aNumber and you will see.  But why did it reach 2.0? Are those math teachers wrong?  "
