  "title": "",
  "body": "  Consider the following function. Which assert should be added to check its precondition?   def getfirst(msg): \"\"\"returns first character of msg Precondition: len(msg) > 0 \"\"\" return msg[0]       assert len(msg) <= 0   Incorrect. Use the precondition as the condition for the assert.     assert len(msg) > 0   Correct. Use the precondition as the condition for the assert.     assert msg[0]   Incorrect. Use the precondition as the condition for the assert.     none of these   Incorrect. Use the precondition as the condition for the assert.    "
